3. Two Defects to Log in Bugzilla

   Defect 1 – PhonePe UPI Payment
    
   Summary: UPI payment fails even though the bank account has sufficient balance.
   Application: PhonePe
   Module: UPI Payment
   Severity:Critical
   Priority:High
   Build/Version: 12.8.0
   Steps to Reproduce:
    
   i. Open PhonePe.
   ii. Select any UPI payment option.
   iii. Enter a valid UPI ID and amount.
   iv. Confirm the payment using UPI PIN.
   Expected Result: Payment should be completed successfully and a confirmation should be displayed.
   Actual Result: Payment fails after confirmation even though sufficient balance is available.

 Defect 2 – Flipkart Wrong Item Added to Cart

   Summary: Selecting one product adds a different product to the shopping cart.
   Application: Flipkart
   Module: Shopping Cart
   Severity: Major
   Priority: High
   Build/Version:10.32.2
   Steps to Reproduce:

  i. Open Flipkart.
  ii. Search for a product.
  iii. Select a specific product and click Add to Cart.
  iv. Open the shopping cart.
  Expected Result: The selected product should be displayed in the cart.
  Actual Result: A different product is displayed in the cart.


